  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JunKeKCJAY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/966726130105217094\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><h1>種樹插樹</h1><p>一個 Fabric 模組，能在 Minecraft 遊戲中自動種植掉落的小樹苗。<br>\n理論上支援其他模組的樹苗。<br>\n若有設定，其他植物也能支援。<br>\n需要 Fabric API。<br>\n如果沒有符合你的 Minecraft 版本的版本，你可能需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quickplant\" rel=\"nofollow\">這個</a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Vo4uFiz0/images/750b02d133f1b574d3c65bc6a73add533a6f9e91.png\" alt=\"樹苗掉落\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Vo4uFiz0/images/24190b563d28d46608d68a569ab8df98e6f87eb5.png\" alt=\"樹苗種植\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Vo4uFiz0/images/bfeb7270723278251566b47882d267cbfef18d84.png\" alt=\"其他植物\"></p><h2>聯絡我</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.net%252f%2540muyucloud\" rel=\"nofollow\">請我喝杯咖啡</a><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.bilibili.com%252f563537522129988306\" rel=\"nofollow\">QQ 聊天群組</a><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitee.com%252fmuyu-twilighter%252fsaplanting_fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gitee</a><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mcmod.cn%252fclass%252f5221.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCMOD</a><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f291040380\" rel=\"nofollow\">bilibili</a></p>",
